WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,440
This is for your personal belongings

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,840
What happened before was really not me

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,240
I don’t require you to believe it right away

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,640
It's not your salary for him to do this

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,240
It's up to you whether you want to accept it or not.

6
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,240
I reserve my opinion for now

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,440
How will you handle caring?

8
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,440
I just don’t want to be treated as a soft persimmon anymore

9
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:17,460
I'd rather perform this

10
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,060
You nod the rules yourself

11
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,260
Okay, just move it

12
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,060
You finally learned to set the rules before playing.

13
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,460
I did too much business with you.

14
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,660
It's hard to imagine

15
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,670
We are going to go to Xue Ya’s place to change the facial mask for a long time to make sure.

16
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:29,670
One ticket for three days

17
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,470
Good value for us

18
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,870
Public water sources will remain available in the future.

19
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,670
But here I have food distributed according to labor

20
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:35,870
No longer default to you

21
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:41,230
In and out, what else do you call a team?

22
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:45,570
Go to his place today and come back tomorrow

23
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,170
What you want is loyalty

24
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,170
Still don’t allow others to leave, at least stay with me

25
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,570
I won’t leave just now

26
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:51,970
Sister Xue Ya

27
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:54,370
Then if the conditions are really not suitable in the future

28
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:56,490
Can't we leave too?

29
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:57,690
A really capable team

30
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:00,490
You don’t need to rely on not being allowed to leave to keep people, anyone can leave

31
00:01:00,490 --> 00:01:01,490
Everyone is still willing to stay

32
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:02,490
That's called a team
